OL,3,AActor Mellor's gurning beaten by
OL,4,ACumbria man
OL,5,
OL,6,FActor Will Mellor has come a surprise
OL,7,Fsecond in the World Gurning
OL,8,FChampionships, pipped to the main prize
OL,9,Fby local man Ged Eccles who had come
OL,10,Fclose but never before won.
OL,12,FPart of the annual Egremont Crab Fair
OL,13,Fin Cumbria, which began in 1267, the
OL,14,Fgurning competition has been a fixture
OL,15,Fsince the 1500s. Competitors are judged
OL,16,Fon their ability to pull the ugliest or
OL,17,Fmost grotesque face.
OL,19,FThe Hollyoaks and Mr Bates vs The Post
OL,20,FOffice star won second place in the
OL,21,Fmen's competition after attending as
OL,22,Fpart of a programme he was filming.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
