OL,3,AActor Mellor's gurning beaten by
OL,4,ACumbria man
OL,5,
OL,6,FEccles said he felt "ecstatic" to have
OL,7,Ffinally won the men's competition. It
OL,8,Fwas his first victory since becoming
OL,9,Fthe junior champion in 1985.
